✅ All statistical measures have formal definitions  
✅ Theorems proven in multiple proof assistants  
✅ Clear disclaimers on quantum terminology  
✅ Testable hypotheses with empirical metrics  
✅ Reproducible computational implementations  
✅ Separation of evidence from interpretation  

